{"slug":"/references/cart/listAndCountCarts","title":"listAndCountCarts - Cart Module Reference","frontmatter":{"displayed_sidebar":"cartReference","slug":"/references/cart/listAndCountCarts","sidebar_label":"listAndCountCarts"},"toc":[{"title":"Example","id":"example","level":2},{"title":"Parameters","id":"listandcountcarts-parameters","level":2},{"title":"Returns","id":"listandcountcarts-returns","level":2}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This documentation provides a reference to the `listAndCountCarts` method. This belongs to the Cart Module."},{"kind":"note","variant":"note","html":"You should only use this methods when implementing complex customizations. For common cases, check out [available workflows instead](/medusa-workflows-reference)."},{"kind":"markdown","html":"This method retrieves a paginated list of carts along with the total count of available carts satisfying the provided filters."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","id":"example"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"To retrieve a list of carts using their IDs:\n\n```ts\nconst [carts, count] = await cartModuleService.listAndCountCarts({\n  id: [\"cart_123\", \"cart_321\"],\n})\n```\n\nTo specify relations that should be retrieved within the carts:"},{"kind":"note","variant":"note","html":"You can only retrieve data models defined in the same module. To retrieve linked data models\nfrom other modules, use [Query](https://docs.medusajs.com/learn/fundamentals/module-links/query) instead."},{"kind":"markdown","html":"```ts\nconst [carts, count] = await cartModuleService.listAndCountCarts(\n  {\n    id: [\"cart_123\", \"cart_321\"],\n  },\n  {\n    relations: [\"shipping_address\"],\n  }\n)\n```\n\nBy default, only the first `15` records are retrieved. You can control pagination by specifying the `skip` and `take` properties of the `config` parameter:\n\n```ts\nconst [carts, count] = await cartModuleService.listAndCountCarts(\n  {\n    id: [\"cart_123\", \"cart_321\"],\n  },\n  {\n    relation